    static let deckConfigDesiredRetentionTooltip = "By default, Anki schedules cards so that you have a 90% chance of remembering them when they come up for review again. If you increase this value, Anki will show cards more frequently to increase the chances of you remembering them. If you decrease the value, Anki will show cards less frequently, and you will forget more of them. Be conservative when adjusting this - higher values will greatly increase your workload, and lower values can be demoralizing when you forget a lot of material."
